Providing false information to registered
SF0056
agents.
Sponsored By: Joint Corporations, Elections & Political
Subdivisions Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to corporations, partnerships and associations; amending the
grounds for administrative dissolution, revocation and forfeiture to include
providing false or fraudulent information to the registered agent; and providing
for an effective date.
